0 -1 TD
(in the configuration register, and writing values to or reading from reg_spi_data.  The protocol)Tj
T*
(is similar to the UART.  A write operation will stall the CPU if an incomplete SPI transmission is)Tj
T*
(still in progress.  Reading from the SPI will also stall the CPU if an incomplete SPI transmission)Tj
T*
(is still in progress.  There is no FIFO buffer for data.  Therefore SPI reads and writes are)Tj
T*
(relatively expensive operations that tie up the CPU, but will not lose or overwrite data.  Note that)Tj
